Subject: Story 45385 – Route Claims to Review Queue When Pricing Import Fails

OVERVIEW

After reviewing dbo.wf_ib_21_837_import and the related tables (repricing_configuration, claim, claim_workflow, and claim_comment), the proposed implementation is to extend the existing #45385 error/skip path.

BUSINESS REQUIREMENT

When a claim is returned on an inbound trading partner file and pricing cannot be imported because of file/import errors:

1. Move the claim from the configured In Process queue.
2. Route the claim to the configured Review queue.
3. Add a claim comment indicating the pricing could not be imported.

Comment format:

“This claim was returned on <trading_partner_filename> but could not be imported due to ”

